---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---
<Layout title="About & résumé" description="Frontend engineering focused on design systems, platform ownership, accessible interfaces, and helping teams build together.">
  <header class="detail-hero wrap"><div class="eyebrow">About & résumé</div><h1>Build the foundation.<br /><span class="serif">Help the team go further.</span></h1><p class="detail-deck">I’m {profile.name}, a frontend engineer focused on the systems and practices that make thoughtful interfaces possible.</p></header>
  <div class="about-grid wrap"><div><h2>Engineering through a platform lens</h2><p>My focus brings together enterprise design systems, frontend platforms, and AI interfaces. I care about how a technical decision feels to the people who use it — both the customer interacting with a product and the engineer building the next feature.</p><p>Elements brings that thinking into a shared foundation with Lit, Web Components, TypeScript, Angular and React wrappers, and an Nx monorepo. The work extends through tokens and theming, WCAG accessibility, component APIs, documentation, releases, and migrations.</p><h2>How I work with teams</h2><p>I see PR reviews and mentoring as part of technical ownership. Clear feedback and documented decisions help teams build a shared understanding, while thoughtful API governance keeps the system coherent as it evolves.</p><h2>Areas of focus</h2><div class="tags"><span>Lit & Web Components</span><span>TypeScript</span><span>Angular & React</span><span>Nx monorepos</span><span>Design tokens</span><span>WCAG accessibility</span><span>Component API governance</span><span>Releases & migrations</span><span>PR reviews & mentoring</span></div><button class="button print-button" id="print-profile" type="button">Print this profile ↗</button></div><aside class="about-aside"><h2>Let’s connect.</h2><p>For conversations about frontend engineering, design systems, and platform ownership.</p><a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>{profile.email} ↗</a><a href={profile.github}>GitHub / {profile.handle} ↗</a>{profile.linkedin && <a href={profile.linkedin}>LinkedIn ↗</a>}<hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid #cbd2b9;margin:28px 0" /><h2>Résumé</h2>{profile.resumeUrl ? <a href={profile.resumeUrl}>Download résumé ↓</a> : <><p>For a full résumé and employment history, please get in touch.</p><a href={`mailto:${profile.email}?subject=R%C3%A9sum%C3%A9%20request`}>Request résumé ↗</a></>}</aside></div>
  <script>document.querySelector('#print-profile')?.addEventListener('click', () => window.print());</script>
</Layout>
